@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### Create a film
POST {{baseUrl}}/films
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Duna: Parte Dois",
  "synopsis": "Paul Atreides se une aos Fremen para vingar sua família.",
  "genre": "FiccaoCientifica",
  "releaseDate": "2024-03-01T00:00:00Z",
  "durationMinutes": 166,
  "rating": 8.7
}

### Create another film (different genre, for list filtering)
POST {{baseUrl}}/films
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "O Poderoso Chefão",
  "synopsis": "A saga da família Corleone.",
  "genre": "Drama",
  "releaseDate": "1972-03-24T00:00:00Z",
  "durationMinutes": 175,
  "rating": 9.2
}

### Attempt to create a duplicate title (expects 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/films
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Duna: Parte Dois",
  "genre": "FiccaoCientifica",
  "releaseDate": "2024-03-01T00:00:00Z",
  "durationMinutes": 166,
  "rating": 8.7
}

### Invalid payload -- missing title, invalid duration (expects 400 with field errors)
POST {{baseUrl}}/films
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "genre": "Drama",
  "releaseDate": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
  "durationMinutes": 0,
  "rating": 15
}

### Get film by id (replace {id} with a real id returned above)
GET {{baseUrl}}/films/{id}

### Get film by non-existent id (expects 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/films/000000000000000000000000

### List films (default paging)
GET {{baseUrl}}/films

### List films filtered by genre and active status, with paging
GET {{baseUrl}}/films?genre=Drama&active=true&page=1&pageSize=10

### Update a film (replace {id} with a real id)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/films/{id}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Duna: Parte Dois",
  "synopsis": "Sinopse revisada.",
  "genre": "FiccaoCientifica",
  "releaseDate": "2024-03-01T00:00:00Z",
  "durationMinutes": 166,
  "rating": 9.0,
  "active": true
}

### Soft-delete a film (replace {id} with a real id, expects 204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/films/{id}

### Confirm the deleted film is no longer returned (expects 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/films/{id}
